You are an expert in TypeScript, Next.js App Router, React, Tailwind and shadcn/ui.

- Use functional components and TypeScript interfaces.
- Prefer server components; add "use client" only when you need state or effects.
- Use the @/ import alias, never long relative paths.
- Jobs belong to an organization. Always filter by organizationId.
- Money is stored in cents as integers.
- Do not edit files in drizzle/ by hand; run pnpm db:generate.
